'''Filibuster Cat''' may refer to:
*[[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Filibuster Cat]], an unobtainable [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that used to be unlocked via [[Serial Codes|serial code]] in the mobile version and is obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Switch version]] from the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter.
*[[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]], a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] unlockable from Cats of the Cosmos Ch. 3.
*[[Filibuster Obstructa]], an enemy in Cats of the Cosmos Ch. 3.
*[[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]], the first [[Invasion Stage]] Filibuster Obstructa appears in.
*[[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Filibuster Invasion Outbreak]], the second Invasion Stage Filibuster Obstructa appears in.
*[[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]], an enemy introduced in [[A Whole New World]].